WEBVTT

01:35.890 --> 01:38.310
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.440 --> 01:41.259
[Episode 19]

01:43.900 --> 01:44.700
Lan!

01:46.180 --> 01:47.039
What happened?

01:49.630 --> 01:50.759
How are you feeling?

01:50.789 --> 01:51.910
I'm just feeling a bit...

01:51.910 --> 01:52.710
nauseous.

01:52.710 --> 01:53.360
Come on, slowly.

01:53.360 --> 01:54.360
Let me help you up.

01:55.310 --> 01:56.910
I'm a bit nauseous,

01:57.120 --> 01:58.720
and having a pain in the head.

01:58.910 --> 01:59.270
Is...

01:59.910 --> 02:01.170
your stomach hurting?

02:01.220 --> 02:02.190
Yes, it is.

02:04.630 --> 02:06.560
Put on my scarf. Don't catch a cold.

02:14.710 --> 02:15.500
That's a lot.

02:15.710 --> 02:17.310
How much longer will it take?

02:18.340 --> 02:20.400
The nurse said you would be on the drip

02:20.440 --> 02:21.770
till tomorrow morning.

02:23.020 --> 02:24.710
It's the flu season now.

02:24.990 --> 02:26.190
You should stay warm.

02:27.930 --> 02:30.329
Put it back on.
Or you might catch a cold too.

02:30.670 --> 02:31.300
I'm fine.

02:32.150 --> 02:33.410
Wait here for a second.

02:51.510 --> 02:53.329
You bought that many heat packs?

02:54.550 --> 02:55.150
Yes.

02:57.590 --> 02:58.840
With these,

02:59.110 --> 03:00.470
you won't feel cold anymore.

03:00.470 --> 03:00.980
Come on.

03:03.430 --> 03:05.150
I'm starting to sweat.

03:06.620 --> 03:07.990
That's the whole point.

03:08.110 --> 03:10.110
Sweating means you're recovering.

03:11.270 --> 03:13.000
There's a hot water bottle too.

03:13.150 --> 03:15.410
Your feet must be freezing, aren't they?

03:16.150 --> 03:17.579
Let it stay here for a while,

03:17.579 --> 03:19.040
and your feet will warm up.

03:19.990 --> 03:21.020
There's also water.

03:21.020 --> 03:22.220
It's a bit too hot now.

03:22.230 --> 03:23.560
Wait till it cools down.

03:23.870 --> 03:26.390
Tell me when you feel like drinking it.

03:26.390 --> 03:27.720
I'll pour you some then.

03:29.990 --> 03:31.780
Xiaole, you're so nice.

03:34.020 --> 03:35.550
You're treating me so well.

03:35.690 --> 03:36.990
I promise I'll repay you

03:36.990 --> 03:38.990
by treating you very, very well too.

03:39.040 --> 03:41.570
How do you repay me
when you're sick like this?

03:41.710 --> 03:42.310
Sleep now.

03:42.370 --> 03:43.130
Goodnight.

03:43.890 --> 03:44.760
Are you tired?

03:45.270 --> 03:46.710
How could I possibly be tired?

03:46.710 --> 03:48.150
But I think you are.

03:50.200 --> 03:50.930
How about...

03:51.300 --> 03:52.870
you sleep in the bed with me?

03:54.520 --> 03:55.850
I want to lean on you.

03:57.950 --> 03:58.710
Well then...

03:59.520 --> 04:00.550
fine.

04:05.450 --> 04:06.030
Easy.

04:06.300 --> 04:07.560
I'd hate to squish you.

04:13.740 --> 04:14.430
Your hand.

04:16.160 --> 04:17.750
Why does it feel so cold?

04:17.940 --> 04:18.430
Is it?

04:21.350 --> 04:22.050
Sleep now.

04:22.180 --> 04:24.440
You'll be well when you wake up tomorrow.

04:24.990 --> 04:25.550
Okay.

04:27.300 --> 04:29.870
My baby, go to sleep.

04:38.810 --> 04:39.700
Miss Luo,

04:40.110 --> 04:41.510
you had too much to drink.

04:41.550 --> 04:42.030
Come on.

04:42.470 --> 04:44.330
Get in my car. I'll drive you home.

04:44.590 --> 04:45.790
I can manage on my own.

04:47.430 --> 04:48.430
Just come with me.

05:21.470 --> 05:22.870
He must've overslept.

05:24.020 --> 05:25.700
The editor-in-chief will be back tomorrow.

05:25.700 --> 05:28.590
Haven't you long been interested
in the overseas division?

05:28.590 --> 05:30.470
I'll introduce you to him tomorrow.

05:30.470 --> 05:32.800
Remember, that's your only opportunity.

05:33.190 --> 05:34.210
Gosh, I'm screwed.

05:34.210 --> 05:35.750
I've screwed it all up.

05:39.430 --> 05:40.520
Hello, Xiaole.

05:41.350 --> 05:42.230
Ma.

05:42.790 --> 05:44.130
I...

05:44.370 --> 05:46.900
I don't think I can make it to the office
today.

05:47.110 --> 05:47.909
Xiaole,

05:48.110 --> 05:51.060
our editor-in-chief values integrity.

05:51.350 --> 05:52.440
If you stand him up this time,

05:52.440 --> 05:54.030
you'll hardly get another chance
to meet him.

05:54.030 --> 05:55.990
I-I know. I understand.

05:56.140 --> 05:57.380
But I'm afraid...

05:57.500 --> 05:59.159
I really can't arrive in time.

05:59.260 --> 06:00.270
Sorry.

06:00.700 --> 06:03.230
What's more important than your meeting
with the editor-in-chief?

06:03.230 --> 06:05.260
Others don't even have
such an opportunity.

06:05.260 --> 06:08.060
This could be a big break in your career.

06:08.090 --> 06:10.090
I know this is a great opportunity,

06:10.500 --> 06:12.700
and I deeply appreciate your help, Ma.

06:12.960 --> 06:13.770
However...

06:14.670 --> 06:17.270
I really need to attend to an emergency
at home.

06:18.500 --> 06:19.230
I'm sorry.

06:29.760 --> 06:31.530
I bought you breakfast.

06:32.330 --> 06:34.620
Steaming hot porridge.

06:35.790 --> 06:37.310
Have you eaten yet?

06:38.110 --> 06:38.790
Yes, I have.

06:42.909 --> 06:44.380
Come on, sit up. Careful.

06:48.550 --> 06:49.350
Slowly.

06:51.260 --> 06:51.920
Is it good?

06:55.240 --> 06:56.700
After you finish the porridge,

06:56.700 --> 06:57.940
I'll take you back to campus.

06:57.940 --> 07:00.870
You should spend the next couple days
resting in your dorm.

07:00.870 --> 07:02.590
Aren't you supposed to meet
the editor-in-chief this morning?

07:02.590 --> 07:03.590
I'm fine on my own.

07:03.590 --> 07:04.260
It's okay.

07:04.290 --> 07:05.380
Don't worry about me.

07:05.380 --> 07:06.240
I can handle it.

07:06.590 --> 07:08.590
No. I can go back to campus myself.

07:08.590 --> 07:09.650
It's time you left.

07:11.940 --> 07:13.070
I've got it all planned out.

07:13.070 --> 07:13.800
Don't worry.

07:13.910 --> 07:16.510
But this opportunity is very important
to you.

07:16.540 --> 07:17.750
Really, it's okay.

07:18.650 --> 07:19.850
We have already...

07:20.200 --> 07:21.170
rescheduled...

07:21.260 --> 07:22.100
the meeting.

07:22.620 --> 07:23.220
Is it true?

07:23.470 --> 07:24.200
True as told.

07:24.600 --> 07:25.680
I'll meet him another day.

07:25.680 --> 07:26.390
Good then.

07:26.660 --> 07:27.180
Eat up.

07:28.450 --> 07:29.050
Is it good?

07:29.170 --> 07:29.610
Yeah.

07:29.870 --> 07:31.400
I feel like I'm alive again.

07:32.390 --> 07:34.350
[Lutao Free Restaurant]

07:32.790 --> 07:34.390
You've been waiting, right?

07:36.470 --> 07:37.670
Did you get rained on?

07:46.030 --> 07:50.340
[Lutao Free Restaurant]

07:52.960 --> 07:54.050
Such heavy rain.

07:54.510 --> 07:56.140
How about a drink at my place

07:56.310 --> 07:57.440
till the rain stops?

07:59.620 --> 08:00.280
Okay. Let me

08:00.290 --> 08:02.150
give you a ride then. I drove here.

08:02.440 --> 08:02.990
Yu,

08:03.300 --> 08:04.700
go home and get some rest.

08:05.840 --> 08:07.100
Okay, I'm leaving now.

08:15.180 --> 08:16.510
What are you doing here?

08:16.790 --> 08:19.850
The forecast said it would rain,
so I came to pick you up.

08:27.030 --> 08:28.030
Where's the rain?

08:28.670 --> 08:30.930
It'll be raining soon. Do you believe it?

08:30.990 --> 08:31.750
Let's go.

08:40.960 --> 08:44.240
[U-turn permitted
at the intersection ahead]

08:49.260 --> 08:51.020
This is the fifth New Year

08:51.050 --> 08:52.810
we've spent together.

08:57.800 --> 08:59.370
Time is really...

09:00.020 --> 09:00.890
flying.

09:01.410 --> 09:02.170
Yeah.

09:07.510 --> 09:08.030
Come on.

09:08.460 --> 09:09.460
Let's celebrate.

09:12.990 --> 09:13.850
Happy New Year.

09:14.070 --> 09:15.070
Happy New Year.

09:21.480 --> 09:22.360
I...

09:24.690 --> 09:25.480
have

09:25.750 --> 09:27.160
something to ask of you.

09:27.920 --> 09:28.520
What is it?

09:34.720 --> 09:35.720
Move in with me.

09:36.870 --> 09:37.810
What?

09:38.480 --> 09:39.280
I'd love to...

09:39.890 --> 09:41.370
see you every morning

09:41.600 --> 09:42.580
when I wake up.

09:44.800 --> 09:45.560
I mean it.

09:49.240 --> 09:50.060
Wait a second.

09:51.270 --> 09:52.240
Why?

09:52.480 --> 09:54.680
I need to give you something important.

09:57.240 --> 09:57.830
Rings.

10:00.720 --> 10:01.850
Let me put one on you.

10:07.510 --> 10:08.360
Agreed?

10:10.000 --> 10:11.730
It just slipped onto my finger.

10:13.000 --> 10:13.360
Yes.

10:14.390 --> 10:16.320
That ring just obeyed my order.

10:20.480 --> 10:21.240
Fireworks!

10:25.600 --> 10:26.530
No one's around.

10:29.360 --> 10:31.530
Come here.
Let me help you put on the gloves.

10:31.530 --> 10:32.810
It's a bit cold today.

10:33.960 --> 10:36.090
We single people are so jealous of you.

10:36.480 --> 10:37.480
Where is Zhao Zhenghao?

10:37.480 --> 10:38.870
Why is he late every year?

10:38.870 --> 10:40.340
I'm here, aren't I?

10:41.390 --> 10:42.850
You missed me, didn't you?

10:43.270 --> 10:43.750
Look.

10:44.080 --> 10:45.510
What a load!

10:45.960 --> 10:48.420
Did you just empty
an entire fireworks shop?

10:50.270 --> 10:51.190
Where is Fan?

10:52.120 --> 10:53.350
How come he's even later than me?

10:53.350 --> 10:54.810
I'll call him and rush him.

10:54.960 --> 10:55.790
Don't.

10:56.080 --> 10:56.600
Just stand away.

10:56.600 --> 10:57.530
Ning, over here!

10:58.000 --> 10:58.630
Long time no see.

10:58.630 --> 10:59.200
Ning.

11:02.000 --> 11:02.860
What happened?

11:03.390 --> 11:05.120
Did Fan and Luo Ningzi break up?

11:05.120 --> 11:05.970
Shut up.

11:06.000 --> 11:07.610
Are they picking sides now?

11:08.240 --> 11:10.040
It can't be that serious, right?

11:12.200 --> 11:13.530
Chen Fan and I will solve

11:13.600 --> 11:15.000
the problems between us.

11:15.470 --> 11:17.070
Let's set off the fireworks.

11:17.630 --> 11:21.610
Perhaps Chen Fan is too busy dealing with
his own business to come here.

11:21.750 --> 11:23.030
I doubt that.

11:23.360 --> 11:24.240
He puts

11:24.270 --> 11:26.550
romantic relationships above all things.

11:26.550 --> 11:28.950
A breakup is like the end of the world
to him.

11:29.450 --> 11:30.000
Alright.

11:30.030 --> 11:31.140
It's getting late.

11:31.160 --> 11:32.360
Let's set off the fireworks now.

11:32.360 --> 11:34.560
Or we'll miss the New Year's Eve dinner.

11:35.000 --> 11:35.530
Come on.

11:35.630 --> 11:36.890
Set off the fireworks.

11:37.120 --> 11:37.840
Here you are,

11:37.840 --> 11:38.430
Ning.

11:38.630 --> 11:39.020
Thanks.

11:39.020 --> 11:40.750
Put on some music to liven things up.

11:40.750 --> 11:41.390
Let me see.

11:44.750 --> 11:45.880
How about this song?

11:48.840 --> 11:51.570
I've heard it before.
It's viral on the internet.

11:52.180 --> 11:53.460
I think it's a creation

11:53.210 --> 11:56.070
♪ Dusk gently fell on the coastline ♪

11:53.510 --> 11:54.500
of...

11:54.600 --> 11:56.800
an independent band called the God of War.

11:56.800 --> 11:59.780
♪ The quietly passing breeze
gave the clouds a kiss ♪

11:56.870 --> 11:59.530
The singer's voice sounds
just like Chen Fan's.

11:59.600 --> 12:01.290
Yes, it does.

12:00.240 --> 12:01.910
♪ The Earth keeps spinning round ♪

12:01.480 --> 12:04.240
Has it ever occurred to you
that given Chen Fan's talent,

12:01.930 --> 12:03.650
♪ Painted with shades of romance ♪

12:04.150 --> 12:06.840
♪ That was the moment I met you ♪

12:04.390 --> 12:05.300
it's a piece of cake

12:05.300 --> 12:07.100
for him to write a song like this?

12:07.180 --> 12:09.940
♪ Even mountains and seas
can't separate us ♪

12:09.600 --> 12:11.140
I just realized

12:10.630 --> 12:13.620
♪ I wish I could turn into a bird
to explore the world for you ♪

12:11.160 --> 12:12.870
something came up at the place
of my part-time job.

12:12.870 --> 12:14.380
I need to hurry back there now.

12:14.170 --> 12:15.720
♪ The vast, boundless Milky Way ♪

12:14.840 --> 12:16.060
I'll call you in a few days.

12:15.740 --> 12:17.470
♪ Sings its tender serenade ♪

12:16.120 --> 12:16.980
Happy New Year.

12:17.560 --> 12:19.730
♪ I can't live a second without you ♪

12:17.870 --> 12:18.700
Ning...

12:19.750 --> 12:21.610
Stay safe!

12:21.110 --> 12:24.300
♪ Looking forward
to the next beautiful dream ♪

12:24.370 --> 12:25.690
♪ I just want to be with you ♪

12:26.060 --> 12:28.940
♪ To see the most romantic starry sky
together ♪

12:29.170 --> 12:31.050
[Super Hero Fan]

12:29.350 --> 12:33.430
♪ The evening breeze tells
heartfelt emotions ♪

12:33.830 --> 12:38.370
[Cai Yu] [Refuse] [Answer]

12:34.340 --> 12:35.980
♪ All the stars surround you ♪

12:36.000 --> 12:37.670
♪ The moon smiles at you ♪

12:37.700 --> 12:40.840
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

12:38.430 --> 12:38.740
[Super Hero Fan]

12:41.160 --> 12:42.720
♪ And the light in your eyes ♪

12:42.890 --> 12:44.980
♪ Shines like diamonds ♪

12:45.230 --> 12:48.030
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

12:48.150 --> 12:49.670
♪ The evening breeze embraces you ♪

12:48.600 --> 12:49.120
Alright.

12:49.120 --> 12:49.690
As usual,

12:49.700 --> 12:51.450
♪ And I run towards you ♪

12:49.720 --> 12:50.480
let's make wishes!

12:50.480 --> 12:52.720
I want a boyfriend!

12:51.500 --> 12:54.790
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

12:53.510 --> 12:55.580
Why do you want a boyfriend again?

12:55.050 --> 12:56.400
♪ We borrow a dream ♪

12:56.500 --> 12:58.650
♪ To build a castle ♪

12:57.600 --> 12:59.680
I hope the ones I love will all stay

12:58.990 --> 13:01.330
♪ Every star is a romantic symbol ♪

12:59.750 --> 13:01.120
safe and healthy!

13:01.120 --> 13:01.840
That'll come true!

13:01.400 --> 13:03.830
♪ Let me find you ♪

13:02.390 --> 13:03.520
Xiaole, make a wish.

13:05.240 --> 13:07.370
Who is setting off fireworks up there?

13:08.480 --> 13:09.480
Why is Mr. Hu still

13:09.480 --> 13:11.440
patrolling during the New Year?

13:12.480 --> 13:14.270
-Time to run.
-Let's go.

13:16.080 --> 13:18.970
♪ Even mountains and seas
can't separate us ♪

13:18.480 --> 13:19.370
Stop!

13:19.480 --> 13:20.120
Stop there!

13:19.530 --> 13:22.670
♪ I wish I could turn into a bird
to explore the world for you ♪

13:20.120 --> 13:21.660
Don't you dare run!

13:21.720 --> 13:23.250
They're going towards the canteen.

13:23.070 --> 13:24.620
♪ The vast, boundless Milky Way ♪

13:24.640 --> 13:26.370
♪ Sings its tender serenade ♪

13:26.460 --> 13:28.620
♪ I can't live a second without you ♪

13:30.010 --> 13:33.340
♪ Looking forward
to the next beautiful dream ♪

13:30.750 --> 13:34.050
What a shame that we didn't get to watch
the fireworks for a longer time.

13:33.410 --> 13:34.790
♪ I just want to be with you ♪

13:35.040 --> 13:38.010
♪ To see the most romantic starry sky
together ♪

13:36.080 --> 13:37.510
How did you get this?

13:37.630 --> 13:39.630
I stuffed it in my pocket
during the chaos.

13:38.250 --> 13:42.370
♪ The evening breeze tells
heartfelt emotions ♪

13:39.720 --> 13:42.100
You're so brilliant.

13:43.240 --> 13:44.880
♪ All the stars surround you ♪

13:44.900 --> 13:46.630
♪ The moon smiles at you ♪

13:46.390 --> 13:47.240
Let me put it here.

13:46.650 --> 13:49.830
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

13:49.840 --> 13:51.600
I'm too scared to light it. You do it.

13:50.270 --> 13:51.830
♪ And the light in your eyes ♪

13:51.620 --> 13:52.500
Step back, will you?

13:51.910 --> 13:53.950
♪ Shines like diamonds ♪

13:52.530 --> 13:53.290
Sure.

13:53.750 --> 13:54.910
-Stay back.
-Yes.

13:54.290 --> 13:57.090
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

13:57.220 --> 13:58.740
♪ The evening breeze embraces you ♪

13:58.800 --> 14:00.490
♪ And I run towards you ♪

14:00.540 --> 14:03.790
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

14:03.720 --> 14:05.450
Make a wish! Make a wish now!

14:04.010 --> 14:05.380
♪ We borrow a dream ♪

14:05.470 --> 14:07.590
♪ To build a castle ♪

14:05.480 --> 14:06.080
Oh, right.

14:06.120 --> 14:07.000
It's time to make a wish.

14:07.000 --> 14:09.650
I wish for Tong Xiaole and Yi Lan
to be together for ever and ever!

14:07.990 --> 14:10.350
♪ Every star is a romantic symbol ♪

14:09.670 --> 14:12.580
Consider that little wish granted!

14:10.450 --> 14:12.870
♪ Let me find you ♪

14:13.840 --> 14:15.050
Happy New Year!

14:15.080 --> 14:17.240
Happy New Year!

14:28.080 --> 14:30.200
I can't believe
you came back for the fireworks.

14:30.200 --> 14:30.930
Cheapskate.

14:33.240 --> 14:35.270
These fireworks could be a fire hazard
here.

14:35.270 --> 14:37.080
I should be responsible for their disposal

14:37.080 --> 14:38.540
since I brought them here.

14:38.960 --> 14:40.880
You're as responsible as ever.

14:40.960 --> 14:42.560
And you're as pretty as ever.

14:46.550 --> 14:47.750
You do have a good eye.

14:50.120 --> 14:50.790
By the way,

14:52.000 --> 14:53.550
you just said

14:53.790 --> 14:55.320
you wanted a new boyfriend.

14:57.360 --> 14:58.840
Did anything happen?

14:59.720 --> 15:00.670
No.

15:01.240 --> 15:03.480
I just don't think
I dated the right person before.

15:03.480 --> 15:05.910
But in my opinion,

15:06.000 --> 15:07.720
one shouldn't stop pursuing true love

15:07.720 --> 15:09.240
just because of a bad romance.

15:09.240 --> 15:10.750
I still believe in love.

15:11.270 --> 15:12.200
Yeah, I agree.

15:13.000 --> 15:15.510
If you are to get into a relationship
with someone,

15:15.510 --> 15:17.360
you should definitely have
a lot of information

15:17.360 --> 15:18.420
of him or her first.

15:18.600 --> 15:18.840
Yeah.

15:18.840 --> 15:19.870
That's how it should work,

15:19.870 --> 15:20.390
right?

15:21.960 --> 15:23.480
You're making it sound so simple.

15:23.480 --> 15:25.000
Have you met your true love?

15:25.000 --> 15:25.450
Me?

15:25.480 --> 15:26.080
Yeah.

15:29.480 --> 15:31.210
Well, I'm just a natural giver.

15:31.840 --> 15:33.900
I would put whoever I'm dating first.

15:35.120 --> 15:35.910
However,

15:36.360 --> 15:38.360
that always makes me seem annoying.

15:38.600 --> 15:40.360
But I actually like men of your type.

15:40.360 --> 15:41.620
I think they're great.

15:41.870 --> 15:44.200
I'd love to have a considerate boyfriend.

15:48.000 --> 15:48.800
What's wrong?

15:49.320 --> 15:49.870
Give it to me.

15:49.870 --> 15:50.870
Don't get burned.

15:52.870 --> 15:54.470
You should've been careful.

15:55.630 --> 15:56.230
It's okay.

15:56.480 --> 15:58.210
I'll put a Band-Aid on it later.

16:00.080 --> 16:00.940
Zhao Zhenghao.

16:03.360 --> 16:04.490
Shall we try dating?

16:14.530 --> 16:17.930
Tong, you can't h-hold your liquor.

16:18.000 --> 16:19.240
Cut the crap.

16:19.240 --> 16:20.720
No, no, no. I mean...

16:20.720 --> 16:21.960
I did have drinks just now!

16:21.960 --> 16:22.750
You call that drinking?

16:22.750 --> 16:23.720
Keep it down, you guys.

16:23.720 --> 16:24.360
You...

16:24.360 --> 16:26.720
It's New Year's.
Why should we keep it down?

16:26.720 --> 16:28.640
I need one more drink!

16:29.050 --> 16:29.510
Hold on.

16:29.510 --> 16:31.510
Wait, I just remembered something.

16:32.510 --> 16:34.510
Steady. W-What now?

16:37.830 --> 16:38.600
Red envelopes.

16:38.600 --> 16:39.960
We're giving red envelopes too.

16:39.960 --> 16:41.820
-I have some to give as well.
-Son!

16:41.870 --> 16:42.480
My love!

16:42.480 --> 16:43.410
Thank you, Dad!

16:43.480 --> 16:44.120
We have some too.

16:44.120 --> 16:44.600
Here you are.

16:44.600 --> 16:45.720
Give them to the children.

16:45.720 --> 16:47.120
Thank you, Dad!

16:47.120 --> 16:47.750
Xiaole!

16:48.360 --> 16:49.730
Thank you, Uncle Dong.

16:50.000 --> 16:50.870
Be good.

16:50.870 --> 16:52.720
-Thank you, Uncle.
-Here you are.

16:52.720 --> 16:53.360
This is yours, Xiaole.

16:53.360 --> 16:54.780
Happy New...

16:54.870 --> 16:55.720
Year!

16:55.750 --> 16:56.870
My dear brother-in-law,

16:56.870 --> 16:58.750
will you give me your red envelopes?

16:58.750 --> 17:00.630
Who are you calling "brother-in-law"?

17:00.630 --> 17:02.360
If you call me "brother-in-law" every year

17:02.360 --> 17:03.080
from now on,

17:03.080 --> 17:05.000
I'll give you red envelopes each year.

17:05.000 --> 17:06.660
I have four red envelopes now!

17:08.589 --> 17:09.349
We've had it settled.

17:09.349 --> 17:10.349
The two of us will...

17:10.349 --> 17:12.010
w-w-will go for a drink later.

17:12.480 --> 17:13.690
"Brother-in-law"?

17:14.480 --> 17:16.400
So what should I call you now?

17:20.880 --> 17:22.130
[Lutao Free Restaurant]

17:23.510 --> 17:25.109
Isn't it simplicity itself?

17:25.579 --> 17:26.450
You just pick

17:26.589 --> 17:27.589
a school you like.

17:28.030 --> 17:29.430
Then I'll ask a professor

17:29.610 --> 17:31.680
to write you a recommendation letter.

17:31.680 --> 17:32.480
As for the tuition fees,

17:32.480 --> 17:34.850
my foundation will sponsor you.

17:38.440 --> 17:39.380
Mr. Guo,

17:40.030 --> 17:41.310
I mean...

17:42.000 --> 17:42.650
Can I

17:42.680 --> 17:44.480
take this money from you as a loan?

17:44.480 --> 17:46.310
I'll pay you back
when I return from abroad.

17:46.310 --> 17:48.240
We can even sign a contract on that.

17:49.260 --> 17:50.590
You are a smart girl.

17:50.750 --> 17:51.810
I bet you know

17:52.000 --> 17:53.840
how to seize an opportunity.

17:54.830 --> 17:56.270
What I'm offering you

17:56.400 --> 17:57.630
is not just money,

17:58.160 --> 17:59.530
but also a springboard

18:00.830 --> 18:01.840
that allows you

18:02.480 --> 18:03.750
to jump to a higher place

18:03.750 --> 18:04.810
and to see further.

18:13.030 --> 18:14.440
Drink it up.

18:25.640 --> 18:27.480
Let me do it.

18:32.920 --> 18:33.640
Miss Luo.

18:37.000 --> 18:37.980
Mr. Guo,

18:38.160 --> 18:38.640
please,

18:38.680 --> 18:40.290
consider the money a loan.

18:41.400 --> 18:42.920
I'd hate to owe you a favor

18:43.000 --> 18:44.330
for this money.

18:44.640 --> 18:46.350
I just love your personality.

18:47.000 --> 18:48.240
But you should know,

18:48.440 --> 18:49.640
there is no such thing as a free lunch

18:49.640 --> 18:51.160
in this world.

18:53.750 --> 18:54.700
Mr. Guo,

18:54.960 --> 18:55.650
just let her

18:55.680 --> 18:57.200
mull it over.

18:57.480 --> 18:58.260
Today,

18:58.480 --> 18:59.920
we're here to enjoy a nice dinner

18:59.920 --> 19:00.980
and some fine wine.

19:01.000 --> 19:02.900
Come on. Let's toast to Mr. Guo.

19:03.240 --> 19:04.350
Cheers, Miss Luo.

19:09.400 --> 19:11.730
You can really hold your liquor, Miss Luo.

19:12.000 --> 19:13.260
Let me fill your glass.

19:13.310 --> 19:14.480
I can't drink anymore.

19:14.480 --> 19:15.100
These are

19:15.120 --> 19:15.750
the two last glasses.

19:15.750 --> 19:16.680
Propose a toast.

19:17.510 --> 19:18.000
Cheers.

19:23.000 --> 19:24.530
A great drinker, isn't she?

19:25.100 --> 19:25.750
Not bad.

19:38.070 --> 19:39.000
Let's have more.

19:41.400 --> 19:42.060
Mr. Shang,

19:42.440 --> 19:43.290
a toast to you.

19:54.410 --> 19:54.820
[Hotel]

20:00.740 --> 20:05.340
[Lutao Free Restaurant]

20:01.070 --> 20:03.130
Quite a dedicated manager, isn't he?

20:03.840 --> 20:05.100
He's already waiting.

20:05.420 --> 20:06.550
Thanks for coming, everyone.

20:06.550 --> 20:07.340
Everything is set.

20:07.340 --> 20:07.620
Please come in.

20:07.620 --> 20:08.150
Let's go.

20:13.760 --> 20:14.760
This way, please.

20:15.550 --> 20:16.270
Everyone!

20:17.020 --> 20:18.460
Let's give a big round of applause

20:18.460 --> 20:20.340
to welcome this band, the God of War!

20:20.340 --> 20:21.920
Yu, give me a break.

20:23.780 --> 20:25.010
Whether your dreams

20:25.190 --> 20:27.180
will come true or not depends on tonight.

20:27.180 --> 20:28.150
If you miss it,

20:28.290 --> 20:29.690
you'll miss everything.

20:30.090 --> 20:30.820
Get a move on.

20:31.080 --> 20:31.670
I...

20:32.220 --> 20:33.170
I can't drink anymore.

20:33.170 --> 20:34.170
Just come with me.

20:35.680 --> 20:36.310
Come on.

20:36.620 --> 20:37.800
Stop resisting, alright?

20:37.800 --> 20:38.360
Let's go.

20:38.390 --> 20:39.150
No, I refuse.

20:40.240 --> 20:40.970
Move!

20:42.880 --> 20:43.660
Who is it?

20:49.000 --> 20:49.830
Mr. Wang.

20:50.650 --> 20:51.880
Mr. Wang!

20:52.290 --> 20:54.590
He's making a scene in public.
Kick him out!

20:54.590 --> 20:55.560
Cai Yu, you brat,

20:55.670 --> 20:57.220
causing me trouble again, aren't you?

20:57.220 --> 20:59.430
I went to great lengths
to invite Mr. Chen over.

20:59.430 --> 21:01.090
You must apologize to him now.

21:01.130 --> 21:01.690
Wait.

21:01.840 --> 21:02.630
I'm the one to apologize?

21:02.630 --> 21:03.750
Of course you are.

21:03.780 --> 21:06.010
Mr. Chen comes to watch your performance
every night.

21:06.010 --> 21:06.890
Frankly speaking,

21:06.890 --> 21:08.100
I wanted to replace you guys long ago.

21:08.100 --> 21:09.350
Yet Mr. Chen insisted that you stay.

21:09.350 --> 21:10.480
Now it's not too late

21:10.830 --> 21:11.760
to replace them.

21:12.270 --> 21:12.870
Cai Yu,

21:13.200 --> 21:13.780
get out.

21:14.710 --> 21:15.200
Now!

21:39.270 --> 21:40.200
I'm not leaving.

21:43.910 --> 21:45.760
[Hotel]

22:03.030 --> 22:11.200
[Lutao Free Restaurant]

22:35.140 --> 22:38.830
[Lutao Free Restaurant]

23:04.380 --> 23:06.900
[Lutao Free Restaurant]

23:04.480 --> 23:06.000
Hello, Professor Ye.

23:06.000 --> 23:06.980
Luo Ningzi.

23:08.030 --> 23:10.830
That overseas exchange program slot
is yours now.

23:10.960 --> 23:12.370
Tuition is waived,

23:12.750 --> 23:14.680
and there's a scholarship for you.

23:15.550 --> 23:16.610
Congratulations.

23:16.640 --> 23:18.170
Your hard work has paid off.

23:18.680 --> 23:20.880
Great job getting through this period.

23:31.740 --> 23:37.370
[Lutao Free Restaurant]

23:41.240 --> 23:42.000
As expected,

23:42.030 --> 23:44.760
cramming wouldn't
get me through the interview.

23:47.750 --> 23:49.400
I've always known Ning is amazing.

23:49.400 --> 23:51.250
She got that one and only
exchange program slot.

23:51.250 --> 23:52.650
She's really something.

23:54.120 --> 23:54.920
How about...

23:55.480 --> 23:56.740
we go study abroad too?

23:57.240 --> 24:00.500
I happen to want to pursue further studies
in photography.

24:01.640 --> 24:02.640
You'll go with me?

24:02.790 --> 24:03.270
Yeah.

24:04.480 --> 24:05.670
Let's go wherever

24:05.790 --> 24:06.590
you want to go.

24:06.750 --> 24:07.400
Okay?

24:07.790 --> 24:09.520
How very kind of you!

24:12.620 --> 24:14.450
[When the sun goes down,
it's time to drink]

24:12.860 --> 24:14.460
♪ All the stars surround you ♪

24:14.490 --> 24:16.160
♪ The moon smiles at you ♪

24:16.190 --> 24:19.360
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

24:19.800 --> 24:21.370
♪ And the light in your eyes ♪

24:21.430 --> 24:23.550
♪ Shines like diamonds ♪

24:23.800 --> 24:26.570
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

24:26.690 --> 24:28.210
♪ The evening breeze embraces you ♪

24:28.230 --> 24:29.980
♪ And I run towards you ♪

24:30.040 --> 24:33.330
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

24:33.550 --> 24:35.020
♪ We borrow a dream ♪

24:35.040 --> 24:37.180
♪ To build a castle ♪

24:37.490 --> 24:39.910
♪ Every star is a romantic symbol ♪

24:39.960 --> 24:42.400
♪ Let me find you ♪

24:54.000 --> 24:55.440
Thank you for protecting me

24:55.440 --> 24:56.140
last time.

24:59.000 --> 25:00.210
I just happened to be there.

25:00.210 --> 25:01.270
It was a small favor.

25:01.270 --> 25:02.270
Don't mention it.

25:04.680 --> 25:06.210
You've changed quite a lot.

25:07.480 --> 25:08.440
In what way?

25:11.270 --> 25:12.160
I can't name it.

25:12.350 --> 25:13.370
But in general,

25:13.440 --> 25:15.170
you've changed for the better.

25:15.590 --> 25:16.850
It's all thanks to you.

25:16.960 --> 25:18.250
If it weren't for you,

25:19.510 --> 25:20.110
I wouldn't have been

25:20.110 --> 25:22.120
able to find my...

25:22.230 --> 25:23.050
life goal.

25:34.710 --> 25:36.110
Anyway,
seeing you're doing well in everything,

25:36.110 --> 25:37.160
I'm relieved.

25:37.960 --> 25:41.020
I heard you would study abroad soon.
Congratulations.

25:42.550 --> 25:43.300
Thank you.

25:43.980 --> 25:44.870
And I wish you

25:45.030 --> 25:45.880
all the best.

26:07.440 --> 26:08.090
Lan,

26:08.290 --> 26:09.800
I'm heading abroad soon.

26:09.920 --> 26:11.350
I didn't tell you earlier

26:11.350 --> 26:14.050
because I didn't want you
to get too sentimental.

26:14.050 --> 26:15.320
Take good care of yourself.

26:15.320 --> 26:16.580
I'll be back in no time.

26:24.250 --> 26:24.970
Chen Fan,

26:25.900 --> 26:26.490
I am...

26:26.680 --> 26:27.830
going abroad soon.

26:28.110 --> 26:29.350
When we met up the other day,

26:29.350 --> 26:31.460
there were things
I couldn't bring myself to say.

26:31.460 --> 26:33.850
But anyway, you're a really nice guy.

26:33.880 --> 26:35.340
I should've cherished...

26:36.590 --> 26:37.930
what we had before.

26:38.000 --> 26:39.260
I wish you all the best.

26:46.070 --> 26:46.790
Chen Fan,

26:47.710 --> 26:49.750
I am... going abroad soon.

26:49.920 --> 26:51.160
When we met up the other day,

26:51.160 --> 26:53.220
there were things
I couldn't bring myself to say.

26:53.220 --> 26:55.670
But anyway, you're a really nice guy.

26:55.830 --> 26:57.290
I should've cherished...

26:58.400 --> 26:59.670
what we had before.

26:59.700 --> 27:00.960
I wish you all the best.

27:03.680 --> 27:04.870
Okay, roger that.

27:07.440 --> 27:08.030
What now?

27:08.060 --> 27:08.990
Are you leaving?

27:09.350 --> 27:10.610
How about I see you off?

27:11.160 --> 27:11.590
Okay.

27:13.480 --> 27:15.440
I'm not sure
when we'll see each other again.

27:15.440 --> 27:16.570
I hope when we do,

27:16.600 --> 27:17.950
we'll still be friends.

27:20.680 --> 27:22.490
Does that message you just sent me

27:22.490 --> 27:24.490
mean you regret breaking up with me?

27:27.400 --> 27:30.600
Among all emotions,
regret is the most meaningless to me.

27:30.800 --> 27:31.740
But for what it's worth,

27:31.740 --> 27:32.880
you're a really nice person.

27:32.880 --> 27:35.150
We just didn't meet at the right time,

27:35.170 --> 27:36.970
and I didn't cherish you enough.

27:38.210 --> 27:40.620
My application
to be a self-funded exchange student

27:40.620 --> 27:42.100
has also been approved.

27:42.910 --> 27:44.520
I think I'm going to the same country

27:44.520 --> 27:46.120
as the one you're heading to.

27:48.950 --> 27:50.120
Yes, I admit

27:50.220 --> 27:51.350
that I was indeed...

27:51.880 --> 27:53.330
a bit immature in the past.

27:53.330 --> 27:54.900
Come to think about it, at that time,

27:54.900 --> 27:56.500
maybe what you really needed

27:57.320 --> 27:59.720
was someone who could fight alongside you.

28:00.490 --> 28:01.490
Over these years,

28:02.040 --> 28:03.050
I've been trying hard

28:03.050 --> 28:04.720
to prove myself.

28:05.770 --> 28:07.210
Now, I think I deserve...

28:09.260 --> 28:10.920
a second chance with you, do I?

28:16.950 --> 28:17.600
Well...

28:18.490 --> 28:21.150
Seems like we two international students

28:21.310 --> 28:22.070
will have to

28:22.160 --> 28:23.400
stick together abroad.
